Output queue-demo.gif

Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1050
Set Height 560
Set Padding 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# 11 Renovate PRs are open on mastodon/mastodon — which ones need a human?"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "lockvet queue mastodon/mastodon"
Enter
Sleep 12s
Sleep 4s
